    "description": "Single segment inside Segmented Control. 8 variants: selected (false/true) × state (default, hover) × size (md, sm). Selection is persistent — a click commits, not previews. Optional leading/trailing icons via boolean instance-swap. Only default and hover states are defined here; pressed/focus/disabled are handled by the parent assembly treating the segment as a radio.",
